NCT07105176.eligibility:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. Age: 18 to 75 years old;
2. Patients with advanced, recurrent, or metastatic non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) who have been confirmed by cytology or histology and have failed at least one line of standard first-line therapy. Patients with non-squamous NSCLC who are negative for EGFR/ALK/ROS1 driver mutations.
